  /** Denotes if Online payment Reconciliation functionality is enabled for the buyers.  If the value for this field (the tag is not sent) is not provided, the system defaults it to False.   Valid Values are 'True' and 'False'. The value can be set to true only if the bank is enabled for Online Payment Reconciliation. */
