  /** - Valid values are True or False - If set to Y, all existing buyers associated with this template will adopt these changes. Updating existing buyers could disrupt payments in progress so before syncing profiles, ensure there will be no negative impacts to existing buyers. If set to N, changes will only be applied to future buyers created after the update Template API is sent. */
  syncBuyerProfiles?: boolean;
