  /** <b>Conditional</b>. This attribute contains the original alias data, e.g. phone number, email address, etc.  The data format should follow same as that of the attribute 'alias'.  <br><b>Note.</b> This attribute is mandatory to selected markets that allow to have one alias linked to multiple accounts. */
